{"id":197,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"It is most active in the wee hours of the night, when moonlight bathes the land. Its large eyes can pierce the darkness and perceive prey with absolute clarity."},{"games":["Shield","Crystal"],"text":"On the night of a full moon, or when it gets excited, the ring patterns on its body glow yellow."},{"games":["Sword","Sun"],"text":"When this Pokémon becomes angry, its pores secrete a poisonous sweat, which it sprays at its opponent’s eyes."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It lurks in the dark of night looking for prey. At the moment it pounces, the rings on its body glow dimly but ominously."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"This Pokémon is nocturnal. Even in total darkness, its large eyes can spot its prey clearly!"},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"With its black fur, it blends into the darkness. It bides its time, and when prey appears, this Pokémon goes for its throat, and then eats it."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Umbreon evolved as a result of exposure to the moon’s waves. It hides silently in darkness and waits for its foes to make a move. The rings on its body glow when it leaps to attack."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it’s filled with a mysterious power."},{"games":["X","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"The light of the moon changed Eevee’s genetic structure. It lurks in darkness for prey."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it gains a mysterious power."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"When darkness falls, the rings on the body begin to glow, striking fear in the hearts of anyone nearby."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"When agitated, this Pokémon protects itself by spraying poisonous sweat from its pores."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"When darkness falls, the rings on its body begin to glow, striking fear in the hearts of anyone nearby."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"UMBREON evolved from exposure to the moon’s energy pulses. It lurks in darkness and waits for its foes to move. The rings on its body glow when it leaps to attack."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Synchronize","hidden":false,"description":"If the Pokémon is burned, paralyzed, or poisoned by another Pokémon, that Pokémon will be inflicted with the same status condition."},{"name":"Inner Focus","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's intense focus prevents it from flinching or being affected by Intimidate."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":35,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"urban","color":"Black","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":133,"name":"Eevee","condition":null,"children":[{"id":134,"name":"Vaporeon","condition":"Use Water Stone","children":[]},{"id":135,"name":"Jolteon","condition":"Use Thunder Stone","children":[]},{"id":136,"name":"Flareon","condition":"Use Fire Stone","children":[]},{"id":196,"name":"Espeon","condition":"Level up, High Friendship (Day)","children":[]},{"id":197,"name":"Umbreon","condition":"Level up, High Friendship (Night)","children":[]},{"id":470,"name":"Leafeon","condition":"Level up, near a special rock at Eterna Forest (or 4 other places) or Use Leaf Stone","children":[]},{"id":471,"name":"Glaceon","condition":"Level up, near a special rock at Route 217 (or 4 other places) or Use Ice Stone","children":[]},{"id":700,"name":"Sylveon","condition":"Level up, High Affection, knowing a Fairy move or Level up, High Friendship, knowing a Fairy move","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,555],[1,33],[1,36],[1,38],[1,39],[1,44],[1,45],[1,129],[1,204],[1,226],[1,270],[1,343],[1,383],[5,28],[10,98],[15,608],[20,109],[25,372],[30,236],[35,385],[40,399],[45,103],[50,212],[55,387]],"machine":[914,226,34,347,204,109,242,174,399,91,38,203,263,313,492,416,270,63,304,808,113,182,244,94,240,115,156,46,1